        "title": "Ramgai neila liangpui lat nuhlo",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ramgai neilaliang pui lat nuhlo,",
            "Kandih khou rui phang lana;",
            "Ai bamni e ramgai khou 5#^,",
            "Kandih lung rianra tuan pu khou,",
            "Ai bamni e hei ram gai khou.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Rianramei abumang tat ro,",
            "Kanloumeipu poubaumei Jisu thei laina;",
            "Nang pap nritmei guai kandih khou heiLou dulana,",
            "Ramgai 5#^ njuanna tatro, tatro.",
            "",
            "2. Ninge gaina bammei nun bam 5#^,",
            "Ramgai kaona lusuan pui bam;",
            "Samthai ethei ngumjaina kum,",
            "Sam kanni e ramgai juanna,",
            "Ringpui thingbang khou samtang ni.",
            "",
            "3. Ringpui tingmik 5#^ ningtou pukhou,",
            "Kandih rianramei guai gumliam;",
            "Ai lunggei mei guai hei man khang,",
            "Kanloumei nahnun bam phu na,",
            "He abumang le sam tatro."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
